            "value" : "Aktiv"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input works in a moment …" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eingaben gehen gleich …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPad Style" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPad-Stil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It asks for a sign-in by naming the site and why. You see the request and decide." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Er fragt nach einer Anmeldung und nennt dabei die Website und den Grund. Du siehst die Anfrage und entscheidest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "it failed a few minutes ago; tried again after 10 minutes" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "er ist vor ein paar Minuten gescheitert; nach 10 Minuten wird es wieder versucht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It must show:" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Er muss zeigen:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It never gets the password; it only learns whether the sign-in worked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Er bekommt das Passwort nie, er erfährt nur, ob die Anmeldung geklappt hat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It opens when your agent needs it. Then you can watch here." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Er öffnet sich, wenn dein Agent ihn braucht. Dann kannst du hier zusehen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It starts now and shows up here as soon as it runs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Er startet jetzt und erscheint hier, sobald er läuft."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It wakes when you open the lid or press a key on the Mac. aOS connects again by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Er wacht auf, wenn du am Mac den Deckel aufklappst oder eine Taste drückst. aOS verbindet sich dann von selbst wieder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s assigned to “%@”. Replacing it removes that shortcut." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
